								<ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
									<li class="flex justify-between items-center bg-[var(--color-gray-darker)] p-2.5 border border-[var(--color-gray-medium)] rounded">
										<span>Pentest na Prática (Desec Security)</span>
										<span class="text-accent">Concluído</span>
